Now as you can see, we can filter
out just the biggest ones.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:15.290
So back to the presentation.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:19.800
So the good news is that all
of this will be open source.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:23.810
And we will be releasing this
in the just in the coming weeks,

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:26.030
starting with an
early access group.

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:31.640
So if you're interested, please
